        {
          "name": "Activate Account",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log(\"Activation Status: \" + jsonData.status);",
                  "    console.log(\"Message: \" + jsonData.message);",
                  "    console.log(\"Next Route: \" + jsonData.next_route);",
                  "    ",
                  "    if (jsonData.status === 'email_not_found') {",
                  "        console.log(\"❌ Email not found. Suggest user to sign up first.\");",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.status === 'otp_sent') {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"user_id\", jsonData.user_id);",
                  "        console.log(\"✓ OTP sent successfully. Proceed to verify OTP endpoint.\");",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.status === 'email_already_active') {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"user_id\", jsonData.user_id);",
                  "        console.log(\"⚠ Email is already active. User can sign in directly.\");",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/activate",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "activate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Activate Account - Smart Email Status Check**\n\nThis endpoint validates the email address and handles three distinct scenarios:\n\n**Scenario 1: Email Not Found**\n- **Condition**: Email doesn't exist in the database\n- **Response Status**: `email_not_found`\n- **HTTP Code**: 200 OK\n- **Next Step**: User should sign up\n- **Response Example**:\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"nonexistent@example.com\",\n  \"user_id\": null,\n  \"status\": \"email_not_found\",\n  \"message\": \"Email address not found in our records\",\n  \"next_route\": \"/auth/sign-up\",\n  \"otp_sent\": false\n}\n```\n\n**Scenario 2: Email Exists but Inactive (OTP Sent)**\n- **Condition**: Email exists in database AND `is_active=false`\n- **Response Status**: `otp_sent`\n- **HTTP Code**: 200 OK\n- **Action Taken**: 6-digit OTP generated and stored (15-min expiration)\n- **Next Step**: User must verify OTP at `/auth/verify-otp` endpoint\n- **Response Example**:\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"user_id\": \"d5cd9e29-5e33-4b2d-be7c-502605e698a9\",\n  \"status\": \"otp_sent\",\n  \"message\": \"OTP sent to user@example.com. Please enter the OTP to verify your account.\",\n  \"next_route\": \"/auth/verify-otp\",\n  \"otp_sent\": true\n}\n```\n\n**Scenario 3: Email Already Active**\n- **Condition**: Email exists in database AND `is_active=true` AND `status=ACTIVE`\n- **Response Status**: `email_already_active`\n- **HTTP Code**: 200 OK\n- **Next Step**: User should sign in at `/auth/sign-in` endpoint\n- **Response Example**:\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"active_user@example.com\",\n  \"user_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"status\": \"email_already_active\",\n  \"message\": \"Email address is already active. Please sign in to continue.\",\n  \"next_route\": \"/auth/sign-in\",\n  \"otp_sent\": false\n}\n```\n\n**Complete Workflow**:\n1. User clicks \"Activate Account\" and enters email\n2. System checks email status\n3. If inactive → OTP sent → User verifies OTP → Account activated → Can sign in\n4. If not found → Direct to sign up\n5. If already active → Direct to sign in"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign In",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Test: HTTP Status Code",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Parse response",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "// Test: Response has required fields",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Response has required fields\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('user_id');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('token_type');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('expires_in');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('next_route');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('status');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('schools');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Test: User data is valid",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - User data is valid\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.user_id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.email).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.email).to.match(/^[^\\\\s@]+@[^\\\\s@]+\\\\.[^\\\\s@]+$/);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Test: Token information is valid",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Token information is valid\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.access_token.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.token_type).to.equal('Bearer');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.expires_in).to.equal(3600);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Test: Status and next_route",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Status and next_route are correct\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.equal('ACTIVE');",
                  "    pm.expect(['dashboard', 'profile/complete']).to.include(jsonData.next_route.split('/')[1]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Test: Schools array structure",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Schools array has correct structure\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.schools).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    jsonData.schools.forEach(function(school) {",
                  "        pm.expect(school).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(school).to.have.property('name');",
                  "        pm.expect(school).to.have.property('roles');",
                  "        pm.expect(school.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "        pm.expect(school.name).to.be.a('string');",
                  "        pm.expect(school.roles).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Test: Roles structure within schools",
                  "pm.test(\"Sign In - Roles within schools have correct structure\", function () {",
                  "    jsonData.schools.forEach(function(school) {",
                  "        school.roles.forEach(function(role) {",
                  "            pm.expect(role).to.have.property('id');",
                  "            pm.expect(role).to.have.property('name');",
                  "            pm.expect(role.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "            pm.expect(role.name).to.be.a('string');",
                  "            pm.expect(['STAFF', 'PARENT', 'ADMIN', 'SCHOOL_ADMIN']).to.include(role.name);",
                  "        });",
                  "    });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Store response data in environment for subsequent requests",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"user_id\", jsonData.user_id);",
                  "    if (jsonData.schools && jsonData.schools.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"school_id\", jsonData.schools[0].id);",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"school_name\", jsonData.schools[0].name);",
                  "    }",
                  "    console.log(\"✓ Sign In successful!\");",
                  "    console.log(\"Access Token: \" + jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    console.log(\"User ID: \" + jsonData.user_id);",
                  "    console.log(\"Schools: \" + jsonData.schools.length);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/sign-in",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "sign-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Sign In - Authenticate User and Get Schools with Roles**\n\nAuthenticates a user with email and password, returning JWT access token and nested school/role information.\n\n**Response Structure**:\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"John\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n  \"access_token\": \"jwt_token\",\n  \"refresh_token\": null,\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 3600,\n  \"message\": \"Sign in successful\",\n  \"next_route\": \"/dashboard\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"schools\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"school_uuid\",\n      \"name\": \"School Name\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"role_uuid\",\n          \"name\": \"STAFF\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Tests Included**:\n- Status code validation (200)\n- Response structure validation\n- User data validation\n- Token validity checks\n- Schools and roles nested structure\n- Environment variables capture for subsequent requests\n\n**Uses captured email from sign up.**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
