        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log(\"✓ OTP verified successfully!\");",
                  "    console.log(\"Message: \" + jsonData.message);",
                  "    console.log(\"Next Route: \" + jsonData.next_route);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{email}}\",\"otp_code\":\"000000\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Verify OTP and Activate Account**\n\nThis endpoint verifies the 6-digit OTP code sent to the user's email during account activation. When successfully verified, the user's account is automatically activated.\n\n**Workflow**:\n1. User receives OTP via email (sent from `/api/auth/activate` endpoint)\n2. User enters OTP in this endpoint\n3. System validates OTP (must match and not be expired - 15 min expiration)\n4. On successful verification:\n   - OTP is cleared from database\n   - Account is activated: `is_active = true`, `status = ACTIVE`\n   - User can now sign in\n\n**To Get OTP for Testing**:\n```bash\npsql postgres://postgres:password@localhost:5432/myschool -t -c \"SELECT otp_code FROM users WHERE email='your_email' ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1;\"\n```\n\n**Response on Success**:\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": \"d5cd9e29-5e33-4b2d-be7c-502605e698a9\",\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"message\": \"OTP verified successfully. Your account is now active.\",\n  \"otp_verified\": true,\n  \"next_route\": \"/auth/sign-in\",\n  \"verified_at\": \"2026-05-21T18:45:56.414487291+00:00\"\n}\n```\n\n**Important Notes**:\n- OTP expires after 15 minutes\n- OTP is a 6-digit numeric code\n- After verification, user's `is_active` changes from false to true\n- User can then proceed to sign in"
          },
          "response": []
        },
